# Gathering of Chaos

## High Level

**Gathering of Chaos** is a volatile, multiplayer card battler where 3 to 6 players fight to be the last one standing (or have the highest HP) over an average 8–10 round match. Players start with 180 HP and a standardized hand, but quickly diverge by utilizing poker-style combat to scale their damage, laying down cards for permanent suit-based buffs, and deploying game-breaking special cards.

